# NEXT_CHAT.md must never be created again, in any spelling or case, anywhere
# (owner ruling 30). Bracket classes because git ignore is case-sensitive, and
# two patterns because it has no optional character. tests/test_no_next_chat.py
# is the stronger guard: it also catches repeated or mixed separators.
[Nn][Ee][Xx][Tt][Cc][Hh][Aa][Tt].[Mm][Dd]
[Nn][Ee][Xx][Tt][-_][Cc][Hh][Aa][Tt].[Mm][Dd]
